{"c":"473053","n":"MORAVICE 3 P","t":"P","s":"MS","o":"Vítkov","url":"473053-moravice-3-p","stav":"2026-10-08","popis":"GPS Z: 49°48'33.292\"N, 17°47'57.162\"E, K: 49°49'14.080\"N, 17°42'58.259\"E\nPřítok Opavy, Odry. Od bývalého jezu nad dřevěným mostem ve Větřkovicích až k silničnímu mostu v obci Zálužné včetně všech přítoků. Všechny přítoky jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán. Nádrž Hrázka (471 059 – Moravice 3 A) k revíru nepatří.\nNejmenší lovná míra pstruha obecného je zvýšena na 30 cm.\nV úseku od bývalého jezu nad dřevěným mostem ve Větřkovicích po jez Annatal (žebřík – pod chatovou oblastí Nýtek) je pstruh obecný celoročně hájen.","delka":12,"rozloha":18,"lat":49.811419,"lon":17.758075,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/vitkov","mo_tel":"603545298","mo_mail":"rybari.vitkov@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":null,"max":null,